{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"852796918836232192","content":"Harvesting:\nSavvy adventurers with the appropriate skill can sometimes find additional crafting ingredients out in the world. Once per day, you can make an investigation check to try and gain a magic essence. After making this check, you can’t try again until the next day. \n\nDC 10 - You find one Common crafting essence.\nDC 20 - You find one Uncommon crafting essence.\nDC 30 - You find one Rare crafting essence.\n\nIf you make this check while on a DM led adventure, roll with advantage. For example, after slaying a monster, you can seach its corpse for a crafting essence. Or if you are traveling through a swamp, you can search around the area for treasure.","created_at":"2021-07-14T20:03:39.239000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864960356765270036","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
